Package: AKScenariosForSS
Title: Alaska Tier 3 Stock Synthesis Projection Scenarios
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Steve", "Barbeaux", email = "steve.barbeaux@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs a suite of Alaska Tier 3 Stock Synthesis 3 forecast
    scenarios from a converged model and prepares five-year harvest
    projection summaries and optional figures. Requires an external
    Stock Synthesis executable for model execution.
